    - Name: <Name>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName4
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Well, I drew my trusty blade, the Silver Crescent, from its scabbard,
        and I charged the beast, belting out a war cry like no other! We fought for
        a mighty 6 hours, sword clashing against claws. When it seemed like there
        was no hope, and the monster raised its mighty wings, ready to finish me
        off, I spotted a small weak spot on his chest.
